+   -0.4720    2.9597    0.3596 H   0  0  0  0  0  0
+    0.9797    2.0221    0.0209 H   0  0  0  0  0  0
+    2.4585    0.9322   -1.6628 H   0  0  0  0  0  0
+   -0.7897   -1.3021   -0.1304 H   0  0  0  0  0  0
